---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="404 · Signal lost · DMSJ" noindex>
  <section class="shell not-found">
    <div class="not-found__code">404</div>
    <div class="not-found__body">
      <p class="mono-label">Signal lost / route not found</p>
      <h1>这条路径没有可解析的信号。</h1>
      <p>页面可能被移动，或者链接从未存在。回到索引，从问题而不是 URL 出发。</p>
      <div class="not-found__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/">回到首页</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/frontier/">查看前沿研究</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/archive/">全部笔记</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.5fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 70vh;
    padding-block: 4rem;
  }

  .not-found__code {
    color: transparent;
    font-size: clamp(7rem, 22vw, 18rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.1em;
    line-height: 0.75;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--ink);
  }

  .not-found h1 {
    max-width: 14ch;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
    font-weight: 620;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .not-found__body > p:last-of-type {
    max-width: 36rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .not-found__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-block-start: 1.2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .not-found {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-content: center;
    }

    .not-found__code {
      font-size: 8rem;
    }
  }
</style>
